  "prefLabel": "Gcd 403.06 Death or Retirement of the Animal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 403.06 Death or Retirement of the Animal. Upon the death or retirement of a service animal, the owner or person in possession of the service animal tag shall immediately return the tag to the commission.\n\nSource. #10341, eff 5-17-13; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
